On available
    Say "Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] requests for you, master. Is this about the [Devil War]? Let's go to Ronark Land."

On offer
    Show quest "We the [Order of the Sorcery] are heading for our victory. However, we also suspect our enemy's counterattack. Hmm...\n\nThis one has the shape of Kentauros and also the shape of a starfish . . . Oh, I was talking about [Devil 10] Commander Buer who you have to fight against this time. It's said that one can be cured and treated only by his touch. It's certainly a good ability. However, since he's our enemy we can't consider his ability a good one. Bring this [Devil 10 Summoning Scroll] and go to the [El Morad Castle] where the [Devil 10 Summoning Stone] is located. Then, summon and destroy him.\n\nYou have to receive [Devil 10 Summoning Scroll] from [Order of the sorcery] Seis, of Ronark Land. Then, summon [Devil 10] Buer from [Devil 10 Summoning Stone] at El Morad Castle area and kill him. \n※ [Devil 10 Summoning Scroll] is free the first time, but from the next time on you'll have to pay a million Noahs."

On in_progress
    Say "Still... I feel the soul of [10Devil] Commander Buer. He must be eliminated fast."

On claimable
    Show quest "Good work. Now we have 18 of'em sealed up. Still a long way left to go. Good luck!\n\nThere are devils who have many troops. They are [33Devil] Gaap and [57Devil] Ose. They say [33Devil] Gaap has a total of 66 troops. Your mission is to scatter their underworld troops by eliminating them."
